WEBVTT

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:09.660
Several Months Ago

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:21.210
People's Republic of China

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:21.210
Scientific Aeronautics Division

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:23.200
Set-up complete.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:28.670
Artificial Intelligence System GBR6, 11:49:57.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.680
GBR7, 11:50:04. System boot confirmed.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.010
Very good.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.040
As soon as you've installed the basic education program...

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.810
...I want you to start them on the Military Training System.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:41.850
Understood.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:49.260
Several months before the Gutsy Galaxy Guard was established...

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:50.390
...the Japanese government...

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.860
...before the creation of the Global Defense Organization...

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:57.870
...started providing other nations, including the U.S. and the E. U...

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:01.700
...with the technology for the GS-Ride, as well as the A.I. Robots.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.330
As a result, here at China's top facility for super technology...

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:08.740
...the Chinese Scientific Aeronautics Division scientists...

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:14.840
...are developing their own A.I. Robots based on the GGG models.

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:20.250
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:23.150
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:30.280
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:34.770
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:41.000
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:45.090
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:49.790
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:53.750
It's time to launch!

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:56.930
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:56.930 --> 00:02:00.850
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:05.550
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:08.510
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:11.430
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:14.180
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:17.690
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:21.360
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:28.890
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:34.890
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.710
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:41.890
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:46.180
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:49.240
Wind and Lightning

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.710
<i>Wind and Lightning</i>

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:01.090
HyoRyu! EnRyu! We'll be leaving soon.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:01.560
Yes, sir.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:02.190
Right!

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.350
Huh? Something going on, guys?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:08.530
They've finished building a pair of A.I. robots in China.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:12.300
Since they don't have much A.I. experience over there...

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.430
...EnRyu and I are being sent over to guide them.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:18.010
Hmph! I wonder if you're up to the task.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:21.380
Never mind EnRyu, who can barely sit still!

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.040
What did you say?

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:26.580
Whoa! Your engine's overheating again!

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:28.450
Let's go, EnRyu.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:31.550
We shouldn't keep the captain waiting.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.120
All right, all right!

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:39.530
Division I Ul-Tech Engine Drive Space Carrier Base Izanagi, separate.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.500
Start the Ul-Tech Engine.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:52.400
Launch!

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:00.950
Izanagi has just entered Earth's atmosphere.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.510
All components functioning normally.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.910
Is the Chief out on an errand or something?

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:08.220
Yes. He had to report to G-Island.

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:11.330
They'll be headed to China after they drop off Chief Taiga.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:12.790
Hmm...

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.260
Okay, let's keep going.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:18.900
According to our estimates, the remaining 27 Primeval cores...

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:20.840
...should fall somewhere in this range.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:22.810
What!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.870
But that means those things could appear...

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.240
...anywhere in the whole world!

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.640
I did do everything I could to narrow the range.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.850
It really can't be helped at this point.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:37.580
I'm sure we'll be able to narrow it down even more in good time.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:41.090
Until then, though, we won't be able to initiate combat.

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.830
GGG Orbit Base.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.700
Headquarters of the Global Defense Force.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.330
Annihilation Priority...

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:55.500
...100!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.140
Thanks for everything.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:15.690
Mr. President...

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:20.390
Rest assured, I have notified all of the relevant department heads...

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:22.460
...and handed over your tasks.

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:29.500
I have been sent to work for the United Nations.

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:31.430
Therefore, I am no longer your President.

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:39.040
I...

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.480
In the name of the planet's defense...

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:45.050
...I have been ordered to leave this corporation.

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:48.650
But once I've fulfilled my mission...

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.320
...I give you my word that I shall return!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.730
Yes, sir. I shall be waiting for you. Always.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:26.330
Command. GGG Orbit Base.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:27.630
Destroy it!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:28.960
Destroy it!

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.230
Destroy it!

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:36.070
Isamu!

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:37.930
What is it, honey?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.510
We have a guest!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:40.700
Who is it?

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:43.680
President Taiga!

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:44.240
Huh!

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:53.050
Mamoru's only wish was not to have his parents worry about him.

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:57.590
So we kept everything, including his Purification power, top secret.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:01.560
But we have reached a stage where that is no longer possible.

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:04.500
I had no idea Mamoru had such a power...

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:09.440
I realize you may be offended by this, but I looked into your background.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:12.910
Mamoru is not your real son...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.950
...is he.

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:21.620
Please tell me...

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:24.410
About that winter night 8 years ago...

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:27.590
The night you met Mamoru for the first time...

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:33.620
I want to know what happened on that snowy field in Hokkaido.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:52.310
All right, then.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:57.890
Violets, lilies of the valley... I love them, and yet why...

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:02.390
Iris, hydrangea... Why won't he come to me?

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.900
Even if it's not as though I asked him outright...

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:09.090
Even when the 31 Primevals showed up...

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.900
...I didn't sense them at all.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:14.330
I can't even Purify their cores.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:16.170
So I guess now I'm...

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.570
All right, will somebody read the rest for us?

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.370
I will, Teacher!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.610
In the skies above North China...

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.920
Izanagi is headed for Inner Mongolia...

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:32.360
...where the Scientific Aeronautics Division is located.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.890
Gai, we have an emergency.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.760
We've discovered a revived Primeval over the satellite network!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.920
ZX-05, you mean?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.960
It's located 200km to your northwest. Hurry!

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:43.860
Right!

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:59.040
All right! HyoRyu, EnRyu, launch!

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:21.540
EnRyu, you've got to do something about that!

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:23.770
You can't pass on that habit to the new A.I. systems!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.700
Dang!

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:29.540
No!

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:35.380
Unbelievable power!

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:39.680
I'll take care of this thing! You lead those people to safety, HyoRyu!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.990
It's no good. It's going to take the two of us to hold this thing down.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:44.550
What the?

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:50.430
What's that?

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:51.400
Don't tell me...

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.830
Zhou-ji Jao-feng!

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:07.120
FuRyu!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.210
FuRyu! RaiRyu!

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.460
Are you the new A.I. robots?

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:19.360
Give us a hand! While we hold off this monster...

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.490
...you guys get those tourists to a safe place!

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:22.960
Start combat mode.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:24.030
Roger!

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.270
TiGao 4!

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:28.770
Rei!

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:30.010
What are you doing?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:33.770
TiGao 2!

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.540
Feng Dao Dan!

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:46.490
Only minor damage to the enemy.

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:49.090
We will now enter hand-to-hand combat mode.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:50.830
Stop it!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:04.870
You can't...

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.540
The Primeval has fused itself with the Great Wall of China...

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.600
...and it's gone underground with the tourists as its hostages!

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:10.580
What!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.850
Are you tracking ZX-05?

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.270
It's no good.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:16.480
There are particles that I can't detect with the Z-Sensor...

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:18.520
...and if they fused with the building...

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:24.420
Excuse us.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.100
We must go now.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:27.950
Hmm...

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:29.360
But still...

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:31.270
Those two robots...

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:36.100
I see you've let the intelligent alien life-form get away.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:37.430
FuRyu, RaiRyu.

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.380
Forgive us.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.110
We failed to fulfill our combat objective.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.450
Normally, this would be grounds for court-martial.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:47.780
But never mind.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:49.050
Now, then...

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:53.750
Our guests from GGG, I welcome you to our homeland, China.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:54.990
Allow me to introduce these two.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.960
They are transformable Battle Robots built here in China.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.260
FuRyu and RaiRyu.

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:03.400
We look forward to getting acquainted with you.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:04.870
FuRyu...

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:06.460
RaiRyu...

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:22.880
All right, I'll be leaving you now.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.590
Please forgive me for this surprise visit.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:30.960
Excuse me, Mr. Taiga...

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.430
What is it?

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:39.070
Is it all right for us to go on living together with Mamoru?

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:44.370
Mrs. Amami, Mamoru is a very kind-hearted and brave little boy.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:47.710
I don't think I'm wrong in saying that it's all because of you two.

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:50.510
So I'm counting on you two to continue to take good care of Mamoru!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:52.920
Oh, yes!

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:02.720
Just as I thought, Mamoru and Galeon are connected by...

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:04.960
...an even stronger bond than we imagined!

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:06.430
We've got to hurry!

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.770
After the battle with ZX-05...

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:18.770
...Gai Shishioh and Dr. Leo paid a visit to the lab.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:22.750
There they met Dr. Yan Long-li, who had been transferred from...

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:25.810
...the People's Liberation Army, Strategic Command No. 3.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:31.450
I'd like to thank you for coming all this way to see us.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:34.820
Oh, it's no trouble at all.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.360
After all, we wanted to know if the Al technology...

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.400
...we provided you with was useful to you.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.790
Did I say something funny?

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:46.040
I assure you, you have nothing to worry about.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:50.970
We have taken your basic theories and brought them to a higher level.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:56.140
In fact, I believe that you'll be the ones to learn a thing or two from us.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.580
Well, that's certainly something to look forward to!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.120
Indeed! With our level of expertise...

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.210
Never mind that! What about the Primeval?

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.810
Shouldn't our top priority be rescuing the captured civilians?

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:10.060
Of course, our military has launched a full-scale search for them.

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:11.350
We're still waiting to hear from them.

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:15.320
Proof trumps theory. I can save you time by showing you.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.000
Please, come this way.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.960
For crying out loud, what kind of combat technique was that?

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:25.700
Thanks to you two, a whole bunch of people got captured!

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.510
EnRyu, that's enough, just let it go.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:32.670
We are unable to accept commands that don't go strictly by the book.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:36.420
What did you say? What do you mean, you can't do as we say?

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:37.720
Stop it, EnRyu.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:41.130
If that wasn't the order you received, then it couldn't be helped.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:44.790
Even so, wouldn't you say that it was a tactical flaw that led to...

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.520
...the sacrifice of those civilians?

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.830
We must prioritize the commands we receive and the highest is...

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:52.200
...to repel the enemy.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:56.370
Minimizing human casualties is not as important.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.540
Good for you, FuRyu and RaiRyu.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:04.380
There is no need to consider unavoidable collateral damage.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:08.510
Dr. Yan, I thought that FuRyu and RaiRyu...

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:11.820
...were built with the same specifications as HyoRyu and EnRyu.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.150
Indeed, you are correct.

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:18.520
However, in their case, we need them to serve in our nation's defense.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.790
Toward that end, I took the liberty of bolstering their weaponry slightly.

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:26.130
FuRyu has Feng Dao Dan which launches compressed air missiles.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:32.840
RaiRyu has Rei Dong which is armor composed of electromagnetic waves.

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:37.380
Even the invasion of intelligent alien life- forms is nothing to fear.

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:42.050
Hmm, but surely it wasn't only their weaponry that you improved on?

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:45.820
Just as I expected, Dr. Shishioh! You are very observant.

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:50.720
I have programmed them with the right mind-set for military weapons.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:54.420
They were built with a different purpose in mind...

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:57.130
...than your Rescue Robots, HyoRyu and EnRyu.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:01.130
Still, their A.I. systems are programmed for self-learning, are they not?

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:05.940
I'm looking forward to see how they turn out when they've matured.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:11.510
Fortunately, you gave us a clear example of just how inefficient...

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:13.980
...these can become without proper discipline.

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:16.110
We shall certainly learn from that.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.840
GGG Orbit Base...

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:44.810
Destroy it!

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:51.580
Prepare FuRyu and RaiRyu for launch! Hurry!

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:52.250
Yes, sir!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.090
Dr. Yan! We're going, too!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.480
Please, feel free!

00:16:57.630 --> 00:16:58.860
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:16:59.830
Mobilize!

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:00.930
Roger!

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.890
I'm picking up vast amounts of the Elementary Particle Z0.

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:07.270
There's no question, it's a Zonder Robo that's...

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:09.270
...fused human beings with Zonder Metal!

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:13.680
Can that Primeval create Zonder Metal internally?

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:16.910
Zonder!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:22.340
Zonder Robos. There's over 20 of them!

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:23.550
What's going on here?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:30.460
This is bad. There are too many cores! We don't have a chance!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:36.930
Hurry, Mic! We don't have a minute to spare.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:42.870
Chief! I've received GaiGar's signal requesting Final Fusion approval!

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:45.800
All right! Final Fusion, approved!

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.210
Roger! Final Fusion!

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:50.450
Program Drive!

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:57.880
Final Fusion!

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:36.690
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.950
It's going to escape to outer space!

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:07.050
HyoRyu! EnRyu! I'm leaving the Zonder Robots to you!

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:08.490
I'm going after the Primeval!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:09.530
Roger!

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:17.300
Take that! Take that!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:19.530
We'll be glad to take you on!

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:22.570
Objective No. 1, destruction of ZX-05.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:24.160
Roger!

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:27.910
Huh! It's those two again!

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.350
This is no time to be looking at the scenery, EnRyu!

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:31.140
Okay, gotcha!

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:35.750
Huh! It's not working!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:38.150
Zhou-ji Jao-feng!

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:48.470
FuRyu!

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:49.560
FuRyu! RaiRyu!

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:56.130
To China?

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.770
Yes. The Primeval has returned.

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:01.370
At this moment, the Mobile Unit is in battle.

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:05.310
Even if I went, I don't think I'd be of much use.

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.680
Special Agent Mamoru!

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.210
Special Agent Mamoru...

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.660
You've more than earned your title as a special agent of GGG...

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.190
...by all that you've done until now.

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.660
Am I right?

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.190
Volfogg...

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:20.530
Let us fight! Together!

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:23.830
We still need you at GGG...

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:29.040
Okay!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.070
Ul-Tech Engine, full power!

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:40.250
Waha!

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:51.260
I've got you now, ZX-05!

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:58.530
I have finished my analysis of ZX-05.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.700
I'm putting it up on the Main Screen.

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:02.600
Wh-What's that?

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:06.510
It's reached a depth of 50km below the earth!

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:09.450
And it's pierced the Mohorovic Discontinuity!

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.110
I see! So that's what it is!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:13.510
Damn!

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:14.950
Broken Magnum!

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:24.850
The air's too thin.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.320
TiGao 4!

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:28.630
Rei!

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:33.200
TiGao 3!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:39.810
What a powerful attack.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:42.050
Attacking is the only thing they can do, I bet!

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.910
No damage whatsoever.

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:47.710
Objective No. 1, we will now launch an attack on ZX-05.

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:53.450
Fusion!

00:21:55.590 --> 00:21:56.390
Look out!

00:22:10.340 --> 00:22:11.970
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:18.040
All right!

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:24.450
No! That energy level...

00:22:30.400 --> 00:22:32.800
It's been sucked up from deep inside the earth's core!

00:22:33.570 --> 00:22:35.690
It's going to set off an explosion of magma energy!

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:50.450
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:55.320
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:01.500
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:06.290
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:10.460
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:17.390
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:24.150
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:28.810
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:34.150
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:41.150
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:48.000
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.710 --> 00:23:51.970
A cannon made of magma greater than 10,000 degrees is about to destroy...

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:57.040
...GaoGaiGar, ChoRyuJin, Big Volfogg, and the Orbit Base.

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:00.780
FuRyu, RaiRyu, if you two are true heroes...

00:24:00.850 --> 00:24:04.050
...then let us see you perform your miraculous Symmetrical Docking!

00:24:04.320 --> 00:24:06.220
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:07.820
"His Name is GekiRyuJin"

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:06.540
His Name is GekiRyuJin

00:24:07.890 --> 00:24:11.060
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:15.100
Shuang Tou Long

00:24:12.960 --> 00:24:14.600
This is the Key to Victory!
